{
  "candidateCarrier": {
    "default": "runtime"
  },
  "description": "修改现有 Runtime 的完整 source，使用观察中该对象的原 update target；保留实例ID、位置、尺寸、绑定和未指定字段。省略 staticFallback 时保留原后备；需修复或更新后备图片时可同时指定 strict {assetId,coverage}（coverage 为 scene 或 surface），先经 asset.media.import 导入有效图片，再用其 asset-id 回执引用。source 与后备在同一事务更新；仅换后备时仍提供当前完整 source。速度或机制修改无需新建或 selection.replace，所有修改仍须完整资源闭包与真实宿主准入。修复明确DOM按钮时可附observeButton:{version:1,label:按钮完整名称}，在独立候选宿主点击该实例唯一可见可操作按钮一次，回传点击前后文本/帧供核对；不点击教师live session，不代表自动判定教学目标通过。",
  "examples": [
    {
      "bindings": "values 的 source 来自当前观察、已读资源或用户要求，值须满足本卡 inputSchema；destination 原样复制当前目标。",
      "code": "const input={\"source\":values[\"source\"]}; const receipt=await session.execute(\"runtime.source\",input,destination);"
    }
  ],
  "inputSchema": {
    "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "observeButton": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "expectLocationId": {
            "maxLength": 200,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "expectStateId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "maxLength": 200,
                "minLength": 1,
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "label": {
            "maxLength": 200,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "version": {
            "const": 1,
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "version",
          "label"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      },
      "source": {
        "maxLength": 2000000,
        "minLength": 1,
        "type": "string"
      },
      "staticFallback": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "assetId": {
            "maxLength": 240,
            "minLength": 1,
            "type": "string"
          },
          "coverage": {
            "enum": [
              "surface",
              "scene"
            ],
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "assetId",
          "coverage"
        ],
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "source"
    ],
    "type": "object"
  },
  "invocation": "Builder: await session.execute(tool,input,destination)。input 遵循本卡完整 Schema；destination 原样使用当前 observe/createScope 的目标；只以 committed receipt 判定成功。",
  "name": "runtime.source",
  "recovery": "invalid-input: 按本卡 Schema 修正字段；revision-conflict: 重新 observe 后复制新 target 和源码基线；tool-failed: 读取 diagnostics 修复所指输入/资源/宿主条件，失败不代表已提交。",
  "support": "conditional-on-input-target-resources-and-host",
  "supportedScopes": [
    "slide:scene",
    "slide:global",
    "flow:surface"
  ],
  "variants": [
    {
      "scopes": [
        "slide:scene",
        "slide:global",
        "flow:surface"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "version": 1
}
